# REQ-004: Document Viewer & Navigation

**Priority:** Must Have
**Effort:** None — pre-built ✅
**Risk:** Low
**Increment:** 1 — Inbox & Triage
**Depends On:** REQ-001 (Unified Inbound Document Inbox), REQ-005 (File Format Support)

> ⚠️ **Implementation note:** The document viewer is already built as a reusable component. **Do not re-implement.** V1b/V1c/V1d agents should reference and integrate the existing component rather than designing a new one. Confirm component interface/API contract with the owning team before V1b.

