## User Story

As a practice administrator or clinician,
I need to view documents with clear navigation controls,
So that I can read multi-page documents accurately and efficiently without missing content.

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] Documents open in an integrated viewer within the application (no external application required).
- [ ] Multi-page documents support both scroll-based navigation and explicit page pagination controls (previous/next page).
- [ ] Users can zoom in and out of document content.
- [ ] A fit-to-page control resets the view to display the full page within the available viewport.
- [ ] Users can rotate the document view (clockwise and anticlockwise) to correct orientation of scanned documents.
- [ ] Viewer state (zoom level, rotation, current page) is preserved while the user is working on that document.
- [ ] Viewer works consistently across all supported file formats (see REQ-005).

